=== cq500 ===
Community Kaggle mirror of Qure.ai's CQ500 release (manuscript ref [28]). Cross-check against the original at http://headctstudy.qure.ai/dataset if anything looks off -- that is the authoritative source. Also worth checking: kaggle.com/datasets/fereshtej/rsna-and-cq500-data-frames, which may already contain pre-aggregated label data frames useful for ich_gen/datasets/cq500.py's expected aggregated-CSV schema -- inspect its columns before writing your own prepare_cq500_labels.py aggregation step.

$ kaggle datasets download -d crawford/qureai-headct -p /home/fcse.santoshkumar/ich_windowing/data/cq500
  unzipping qureai-headct.zip ...
  done -- leaving qureai-headct.zip in place in case you need to re-extract; delete it manually once you've verified the extracted contents.

